1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,509
Who placed this order?

2
00:00:01,729 --> 00:00:03,060
The table won't tell you!

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,711
This is Data Analytics, Part

4
00:00:05,711 --> 00:00:07,448
11: SQL JOIN basics.

5
00:00:07,668 --> 00:00:09,207
Our orders table only

6
00:00:09,207 --> 00:00:10,526
has a customer id.

7
00:00:11,246 --> 00:00:12,302
The names live in

8
00:00:12,302 --> 00:00:13,916
