9
00:00:14,136 --> 00:00:15,637
Both tables share one

10
00:00:15,637 --> 00:00:17,282
thing: the customer id.

11
00:00:18,002 --> 00:00:18,880
JOIN glues the

12
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,134
two tables together.

13
00:00:20,354 --> 00:00:21,925
ON tells SQL which

14
00:00:21,925 --> 00:00:24,367
columns must match: customer

15
00:00:24,367 --> 00:00:25,501
id equals id.

16
00:00:26,221 --> 00:00:28,089
Select order id, name and

17
00:00:28,089 --> 00:00:30,705
amount, from orders, join customers

18
00:00:30,705 --> 00:00:32,125
