21
00:00:34,763 --> 00:00:36,049
But wait, order

22
00:00:36,049 --> 00:00:37,334
104 is missing.

23
00:00:37,554 --> 00:00:38,952
Customer 4 does not

24
00:00:38,952 --> 00:00:40,203
exist, so a plain

25
00:00:40,203 --> 00:00:41,233
