26
00:00:41,453 --> 00:00:42,293
It only keeps

27
00:00:42,293 --> 00:00:43,327
rows that match.

28
00:00:44,047 --> 00:00:45,166
To add names to

29
00:00:45,166 --> 00:00:46,509
